">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133593941,imgsize-2425515.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Last known location-Hotel Kailash: NRI couple from Canada Dhaval Shah, Megha missing in Nepal]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133593200.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/last-known-location-hotel-kailash-nri-couple-from-canada-dhaval-shah-megha-missing-in-nepal/articleshow/133593200.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/last-known-location-hotel-kailash-nri-couple-from-canada-dhaval-shah-megha-missing-in-nepal/articleshow/133593200.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-28T19:33:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133593441,imgsize-36896.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2024, a Colorado county paid $34 million for a 650-acre ranch owned for more than a century]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133592492.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a momentous conservation victory, a historic ranch in Colorado has been designated as protected wilderness. This expansion secures an impressive 530 acres of public land, which local officials successfully purchased through a record-breaking deal two years prior. After being privately held for more than a century, this acquisition ensures the enduring protection of crucial wildlife habitats and public access to the land.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2024-a-colorado-county-paid-34-million-for-a-650-acre-ranch-privately-owned-for-more-than-a-century-2-year