 for technology ventures, primarily data centers by major tech enterprises. This shift is impacting farmers, especially with resource competition over vital necessities like water. Concerns have been raised by state officials regarding the permanent loss of fertile land, highlighting a significant transition in the region's agricultural landscape.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-texas-farmers-family-has-worked-6000-acres-for-over-a-century-after-his-landlord-sold-600-rented-acres-for-a-google-data-center-he-was-given-60-days-to-leave/articleshow/133591348.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-texas-farmers-family-has-worked-6000-acres-for-over-a-century-after-his-landlord-sold-600-rented-acres-for-a-google-data-center-he-was-given-60-days-to-leave/articleshow/133591348.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-28T18:24:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133591784,imgsize-2038252.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Engine issue at 31,000 feet': New Jersey-bound United Airlines flight makes emergency landing in Nevada]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133591340.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/engine-issue-at-31000-feet-new-jersey-bound-united-airlines-flight-makes-emergency-landing-in-nevada/articleshow/133591340.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/engine-issue-at-31000-feet-new-jersey-bound-united-airlines-flight-makes-emergency-landing-in-nevada/articleshow/133591340.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-28T18:00:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133591424,imgsize-22936.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Japan killed 14,000+ bears after record attacks; 6 people died despite cull, 8,800 more targeted]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133590301.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Japan is currently grappling with a significant rise in bear conflicts, with incidents surging alarmingly. Conservationists are voicing urgent concerns regarding the extensive culling of endangered bear populations. Factors such as extreme heat and declining food sources are pushing bears into human territories in search of food. While the government’s response aims at curtailing bear numbers, critics label this approach as ineffective.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/japan-killed-more-than-14000-bears-between-april-2025-and-january-2026-after-record-attacks-on-people-despite-the-cull-6-people-have-been-killed-this-year-and-the-government-plans-to-remove-another-8800-bears/articleshow/133590301.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/japan-killed-more-than-14000-bears-between-april-2025-and-january-2026-after-record-attacks-on-people-despite-the-cull-6-people-have-been-killed-this-year-and-the-government-plans-to-remove-another-8800-bears/articleshow/133590301.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-28T17:59:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133590936,imgsize-1358683.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1856, one of Northern California’s oldest cattle ranches was established; 170 years later...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133578134.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a landmark initiative, the Wildlands Conservancy is set to acquire the AP Ranch in Northern California, establishing an impressive public preserve in Siskiyou County. This strategic 14,177-acre purchase will unite with an existing land reserve, exceeding 20,000 acres in total. The project aims to protect essential wildlife corridors and headwaters within the Scott River watershed, while also facilitating habitat restoration and free recreational access for visitors.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1856-one-of-northern-californias-oldest-cattle-ranches-was-established-170-years-later-its-14177-acres-are-being-bought-for-15-5-million-and-opened-to-the-public/articleshow/133578134.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1856-one-of-northern-californias-oldest-cattle-ranches-was-established-170-years-later-its-14177-acres-are-being-bought-for-15-5-million-and-opened-to-the-public/articleshow/133578134.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-28T17:55:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133591318,imgsize-2175890.cms"/></item></channel></rss>